<title>GERMANY: SuedwestLB to transfer SachsenLB stake to Saxony.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB to transfer SachsenLB stake to Saxony.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suedwestdeutsche Landesbank, a state-owned German regional bank, will transfer ownership of its 25.10 percent stake in Landesbank Sachsen (Sachsen LB) to the state of Saxony and Saxony's savings banks at the end of the year, the two regional banks said on Monday.</p>
<p>The banks said in a statement they now planned to intensify their cooperation.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
